    "Refine Exponential Moving Prototype Flow (empf-v2 over empf-v1): raise base far-from-manifold Born-Infeld sharpness ebi_beta from 4.0 to 6.0 and add clock-free state-driven settling Born-Infeld sharpness eff_ebi_beta = ebi_beta + batch_gain * settle_s^2 for ema_residual < 0.16 scaled by prototype-bank batch resolution relative to reference_batch = 128 (6.5 at b_r <= 64 up to 22.0 at b_r >= 128); add post-acquisition Sinkhorn thermal cooling on unconditioned discrete-simplex couplings (preserving t_scale = 1.0 while ema_residual >= 0.070 during acquisition, then smoothing down toward 0.35 over multi-thousand-step holds); and eliminate CPU-GPU count.item() synchronization on the small anchored discrete-codebook fast path in EMPFPriorRegularizer."
